@startuml F7.2-ERRO-01-perfil-em-uso
title F7.2-ERRO-01 — 422 excluir perfil em uso
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "IAMController" as Ctrl
participant "DeleteRoleUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Excluir perfil
WebApp -> Jwt: DELETE /admin/perfis/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: count usuários
Postgres --> UC: N > 0
note right of UC
  sem DELETE
end note
UC --> WebApp: 422 role_in_use
WebApp --> Admin: AlertBanner

@enduml
